Z||000006||filthyscarecrow||08-16-2000||12:41 AM||||yeah, $100 for a set of stickers that you could get for $15. that's what i did to my 85GT. looked really good, but it's not worth $100. for about $40 you can make a genuine carbon fiber dash kit, real easy. just laminate carbon cloth (approx$18/yard) to the original panels. youd' probably even have enough left over to do a shift knob or set of pedals...<P>------------------<BR>me go fast.||||reg||1
